__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# --- TEMPLATE-ONLY: delete this block after you install into your project ---
# These lines exist only so this template repo doesn't ship its own example
# sprint data. If you copied this workflow into a real project, DELETE the
# block below so your sprint definitions and state history get committed
# like any other file. Left in place, every real sprint you create and all
# gate history in docs/sprints/state/ is untracked and unrecoverable from
# git the moment something wipes your working tree, a bad `git clean`, a
# disk failure, anything. This has actually happened; don't inherit it.
docs/sprints/0-backlog/*
docs/sprints/1-todo/*
docs/sprints/2-in-progress/*
docs/sprints/3-done/*
docs/sprints/4-blocked/*
docs/sprints/5-abandoned/*
docs/sprints/state/*
!docs/sprints/*/.gitkeep
# --- end template-only block ---
